{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.poster.avif?t=1757427330\" width=578 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.webm?t=1757427330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Neko Caf\u00e9 Stories</strong>, a cozy and relaxing bubble merge puzzle game set in a stylish anime caf\u00e9 run by charming neko girls. Match and merge colorful sweets to unlock new characters and progress through fun, dessert-themed challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf70 <strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>At the heart of the game is a satisfying <strong>bubble merge mechanic</strong> \u2014 drag and combine matching sweets on the puzzle board to create new ones, complete level objectives, and earn delicious cakes.<br>Every few levels, a new character is revealed, adding variety and charm to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single, elegant caf\u00e9 managed by unique anime-style neko girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>9 different girls</strong>, each unlocked by completing 3 bubble merge puzzle levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and rewarding merging system with clever layouts and gameplay twists like portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn anime visuals with polished details and soothing background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through relaxing levels and enjoy visually delightful rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of laid-back puzzle games with merging mechanics, cute character design, and a relaxing vibe, <strong>Neko Caf\u00e9 Stories</strong> is your perfect treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765830?t=1757427330","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/3b56f414e0fefbddeaac4b1442255fd776ebf041/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757427330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/6c8240b94fcd9a77d717a1ef931b1c814573cfc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757427330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/6c8240b94fcd9a77d717a1ef931b1c814573cfc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757427330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.poster.avif?t=1757427330\" width=578 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.webm?t=1757427330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Neko Caf\u00e9 Stories</strong>, a cozy and relaxing bubble merge puzzle game set in a stylish anime caf\u00e9 run by charming neko girls. Match and merge colorful sweets to unlock new characters and progress through fun, dessert-themed challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf70 <strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>At the heart of the game is a satisfying <strong>bubble merge mechanic</strong> \u2014 drag and combine matching sweets on the puzzle board to create new ones, complete level objectives, and earn delicious cakes.<br>Every few levels, a new character is revealed, adding variety and charm to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single, elegant caf\u00e9 managed by unique anime-style neko girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>9 different girls</strong>, each unlocked by completing 3 bubble merge puzzle levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and rewarding merging system with clever layouts and gameplay twists like portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn anime visuals with polished details and soothing background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through relaxing levels and enjoy visually delightful rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of laid-back puzzle games with merging mechanics, cute character design, and a relaxing vibe, <strong>Neko Caf\u00e9 Stories</strong> is your perfect treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>","developers":["Anime Aqua Games"],"dlc":[3836310],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/93290e4e226a26ce36f4da336285a4f0f1c434df/header.jpg?t=1757427330","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257194562,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194562/movie480.mp4?t=1757339878","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194562/movie_max.mp4?t=1757339878"},"name":"Neko Caf\u00e9","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194562/eaeb6988966ea59849f29c8e5e889df0d25fbb61/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757339878","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194562/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757339